# USB installer image profile: the bootable install environment.
# Installer userspace and menu tooling, plus the boot kernel and
# wireless firmware real hardware needs. The installed machine's
# profile is chosen in the menu, never here: this profile describes
# the installer, not its product.
@saphira-installer
saphira-kernel-7.2.3
# Full firmware set (2026-10-23): target hardware is unknown, so the
# installer carries every family via the -full meta. Bare
# linux-firmware is licence evidence only since the family split.
linux-firmware-full
# Early-boot artifacts for the installer environment itself (unknown
# hardware at install time): microcode image plus the generator the
# installed machine's hooks need in-target from its first boot.
intel-ucode
saphira-initramfs-tools
